1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,250
At TheOneApp Station, every pupil has a character of their very own.

2
00:00:08,808 --> 00:00:11,488
Ooh... why is that one all grey?

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:12,368
No colour.

4
00:00:12,828 --> 00:00:13,928
No style.

5
00:00:14,248 --> 00:00:15,623
Not even a hat!

6
00:00:15,643 --> 00:00:16,463
And look.

7
00:00:16,503 --> 00:00:18,083
The Gift Shop is dark.

8
00:00:18,229 --> 00:00:20,069
Here, style is not given.

9
00:00:20,189 --> 00:00:21,269
It is earned.

10
00:00:21,673 --> 00:00:23,693
Every quiz you finish earns credits.

11
00:00:23,713 --> 00:00:24,819
Let's start!

12
00:00:24,839 --> 00:00:26,949
Which one will a magnet attract?

13
00:00:27,012 --> 00:00:28,374
We need a scientist.

14
00:00:28,394 --> 00:00:29,731
We need you.

15
00:00:30,821 --> 00:00:33,249
A magnet attracts things made of iron.

16
00:00:33,269 --> 00:00:34,429
Quiz finished!

17
00:00:34,479 --> 00:00:35,759
Ten credits!

18
00:00:36,158 --> 00:00:38,238
Day by day, the credits add up.

19
00:00:38,358 --> 00:00:40,148
They are earned, never bought.

20
00:00:40,751 --> 00:00:42,451
The Gift Shop is open!

21
00:00:42,601 --> 00:00:44,891
Safety goggles, fifty credits.

22
00:00:46,239 --> 00:00:47,549
The colours are free.

23
00:00:47,569 --> 00:00:48,709
And the goggles?

24
00:00:48,729 --> 00:00:49,992
Yours to keep!

25
00:00:50,012 --> 00:00:51,362
Spin it in the mirror.

26
00:00:51,482 --> 00:00:53,362
Then take it into every game.

27
00:00:57,061 --> 00:00:58,101
Versus!

28
00:00:58,251 --> 00:01:00,051
Your character against me!

29
00:01:03,652 --> 00:01:04,502
Iron!

30
00:01:04,662 --> 00:01:05,872
You remembered!

31
00:01:05,922 --> 00:01:07,282
What you learn, you keep.

32
00:01:07,452 --> 00:01:08,762
What you earn, you wear.

33
00:01:09,364 --> 00:01:10,251
Earn it.

34
00:01:10,271 --> 00:01:11,086
Wear it.

35
00:01:11,106 --> 00:01:12,146
Play it.

36
00:01:12,294 --> 00:01:14,494
The only app you need to learn Science.

37
00:01:14,614 --> 00:01:15,654
TheOneApp.
